mory is enabled, consult memory_list for useful capabilities and run matching procedures with memory_run, verify their evidence, and investigate only what is missing. In Code Mode with memory, use function_try to explore via the provided primitives and propose useful parameterized procedures. Do not recreate equivalent procedures or nest memorized procedures. Do not write a Tour. Return sourced findings and explicit uncertainties.';\"},{\"file\":\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"line\":28,\"text\":\"  type: 'model' | 'tool' | 'memory_run' | 'memory_list' | 'function_try' | 'decomposition_plan' | 'decomposition_decision' | 'run_end';\"},{\"file\":\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"line\":50,\"text\":\"  /** Per-call reuse outcome of a stored procedure (memory_run only). */\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":237,\"text\":\"      let scriptCall: { type: 'memory_run' | 'function_try'; name: string } | undefined;\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":326,\"text\":\"        else if (codeMode && ((call.name === 'code' && typeof call.arguments.code === 'string') || (call.name === 'function_try' && typeof call.arguments.source === 'string') || (library && call.name === 'memory_run' && typeof call.arguments.id === 'string'))) {\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":327,\"text\":\"          const stored = call.name === 'memory_run' ? library?.get(String(call.arguments.id)) : undefined;\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":328,\"text\":\"          if (call.name === 'memory_run' && !stored) throw new Error('Unknown script');\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":337,\"text\":\"          scriptCall = { type: stored ? 'memory_run' : 'function_try', name: stored ? stored.id : 'function_try' };\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":339,\"text\":\"          // Ticket #191: any memory_run/function_try call — accepted or failed —\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\",\"line\":360,\"text\":\"            // Compact, structured, bounded, sourced output for memory_run AND function_try.\"},{\"file\":\"explore.ts\