o not call memory_list to rediscover it. If no entry fits, build the missing procedure with function_try early instead of repeating searches."},{"role":"user","content":"Dans explore.ts, explique où les appels memory_run sont exécutés. Essaie tôt une fonction réutilisable de recherche ciblée avec le paramètre memory_run ; limite sa sortie à trois références, cite les lignes originales, puis conclus dès que la preuve est disponible."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a55ccabfa8da0022","type":"function","function":{"name":"listFiles","arguments":"{}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a06e95abf8ea7c4f","type":"function","function":{"name":"searchText","arguments":"{\"query\":\"memory_run\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a55ccabfa8da0022","content":"{\"result\":[\".tours/config.json\",\"citation-validator.ts\",\"cli.ts\",\"config.ts\",\"decomposition-prompt.ts\",\"exploration-evidence.ts\",\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"explore.ts\",\"mask.ts\",\"memory-output.ts\",\"memory.ts\",\"mistral.ts\",\"primitives.ts\",\"research-log.ts\",\"sandbox.d.ts\",\"scratch.ts\",\"summary.ts\",\"tool-contract.ts\",\"workspace.ts\"],\"returned\":19,\"observed\":19,\"truncated\":false,\"bounds\":{\"maxItems\":50,\"maxBytes\":8000},\"bytes\":320,\"revision\":\"3e8f2aa7da11dd6d26bbb6e3dffde679471c9780\",\"provenance\":\"primitive-derived\",\"uncertainty\":[\"Primitive matches provide syntactic evidence, not semantic certainty or proof of absence.\"]}"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a06e95abf8ea7c4f","content":"{\"omitted\":true,\"note\":\"Already read, result omitted to save context: searchText({\\\"query\\\":\\\"memory_run\\\"}). Full result saved as chatcmpl-tool-a06e95abf8ea7c4f; use readScratch with resultId and offset 0 if needed. Cite original sources. Rely on what you noted.\",\"bytes\":2752,\"head\":\"{\\\"truncated\\\":true,\\\"preview\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"file\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"decomposition-prompt.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"l