) below, then call function_try again with corrected code.\",\"validCount\":2,\"validReferences\":[{\"file\":\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"startLine\":28,\"endLine\":28},{\"file\":\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"startLine\":50,\"endLine\":50}],\"invalidReferences\":[{\"file\":\"decomposition-prompt.ts\",\"errors\":[\"excerpt does not match the file content at lines 4-4\"],\"startLine\":4,\"endLine\":4}]},\"note\":\"This exact call already returned the same result. Do not repeat it: change the query or parameters, use a different approach, or conclude with what you have and list the gaps as uncertainties.\"}"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8493970b534642e5","type":"function","function":{"name":"readLines","arguments":"{\"endLine\":6,\"file\":\"decomposition-prompt.ts\",\"startLine\":1}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8493970b534642e5","content":"{\"result\":{\"file\":\"decomposition-prompt.ts\",\"start\":1,\"lines\":[{\"line\":1,\"text\":\"import { createHash } from 'node:crypto';\"},{\"line\":2,\"text\":\"\"},{\"line\":3,\"text\":\"/** Guidance for exploring one question after the initial planning call. */\"},{\"line\":4,\"text\":\"export const DECOMPOSITION_PROMPT = 'Investigate the supplied technical question. Treat the initial research plan as a flexible guide: follow new evidence freely without revising or tracking the plan. When memory is enabled, consult memory_list for useful capabilities and run matching procedures with memory_run, verify their evidence, and investigate only what is missing. In Code Mode with memory, use function_try to explore via the provided primitives and propose useful parameterized procedures. Do not recreate equivalent procedures or nest memorized procedures. Do not write a Tour. Return sourced findings and explicit uncertainties.';\"},{\"line\":5,\"text\":\"export const PROMPT_VERSION = '5';\"},{\"line\":6,\"text\":\"export const PROMPT_SHA256 = createHash('sha256').update(DECOMPOSITION_PROMPT, 