ng, ignorering, standardværdi eller exception.\",\"Tjek om parseConfig kaldes fra loadConfig eller andre funktioner, og om konteksten (f.eks. strict-mode flag) påvirker adfærden; inkluder kun det der er nødvendigt for spørgsmålet.\",\"Formuler konklusionen med citater og angiv grænser: hvad der er verificeret i koden versus hvad der kræver runtime-test (f.eks. faktiske fejlmeddelelser).\"],\"reuse\":[{\"id\":\"findSymbolOccurrences\",\"objective\":\"How does loadConfig load configuration in config.ts?\",\"description\":\"Searches a repository for occurrences of a symbol by exact identifier match and literal text match, deduplicates by file:line, and returns up to limit {file, line, text} candidates. Scope: syntactic search only, no semantic resolution. Limits: capped by limit (default 3); text may be empty.\",\"parameters\":[\"limit\",\"symbol\"],\"paramsSchema\":[{\"name\":\"symbol\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"name\":\"limit\",\"type\":\"number | undefined\"}],\"outputContract\":{\"returns\":\"{ file: string; line: number; text: string; }[]\",\"itemFields\":[\"file\",\"line\"],\"bounds\":{\"maxItems\":50,\"maxBytes\":8000}},\"limits\":{\"maxItems\":50,\"maxBytes\":8000},\"uncertaintyCases\":[],\"revision\":\"3e8f2aa7da11dd6d26bbb6e3dffde679471c9780\"}]}\n\nExplore the repository using the tools. Assess whether the evidence answers the objective; if essential evidence is missing, use further tools before returning. Record unresolved gaps in uncertainties. Return only JSON matching this exact shape: {\"objective\":\"...\",\"entryPoints\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"components\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"relations\":[{\"from\":\"...\",\"to\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"uncertainties\":[\"...\"]}. Use empty arrays when needed. Each evidence must be an array of objects with real