DME pour confirmer le comportement attendu quand le fichier manque.\",\"Noter toute incertitude : comportement dépendant d'une variable d'environnement non documentée, code mort, différence entre environnements (dev/prod), ou absence de test couvrant le cas du fichier manquant.\"],\"reuse\":[]}\n\nExplore the repository using the tools. Assess whether the evidence answers the objective; if essential evidence is missing, use further tools before returning. Record unresolved gaps in uncertainties. Return only JSON matching this exact shape: {\"objective\":\"...\",\"entryPoints\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"components\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"relations\":[{\"from\":\"...\",\"to\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"uncertainties\":[\"...\"]}. Use empty arrays when needed. Each evidence must be an array of objects with real file paths and integer line numbers, not a string. Copy line numbers exactly from tool output (each numbered line, match or range); never estimate, recompute or round them. Do not write a tour."},{"role":"user","content":"Dans config.ts, comment loadConfig charge-t-elle le fichier de configuration et que fait-elle quand le fichier manque ? Cite les lignes pertinentes et indique toute incertitude."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b97fd4de9d1d2051","type":"function","function":{"name":"list","arguments":"{}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-98d840e60781e638","type":"function","function":{"name":"search","arguments":"{\"query\":\"loadConfig\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b97fd4de9d1d2051","content":"[\".tours/config.json\",\"citation-validator.ts\",\"cli.ts\",\"config.ts\",\"decomposition-prompt.ts\",\"exploration-evidence.ts\",\"exploration-helpers.ts\",\"explore.ts\",\"mask.ts\",\"memory-output.ts\",\"memory.ts\",\"mistral.ts\