{"level":30,"time":1794926389115,"pid":71737,"hostname":"r179-30-55-14.dialup.mobile.ancel.net.uy","runId":"aeaaf87e-950d-495a-b1e1-4fd4c4389ef3","event":"model_response","response":{"toolCalls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-87d19d36404673cf","name":"function_try","arguments":{"description":"Reads a given line range of cli.ts and extracts structured evidence: the line invoking explore (direct call with its arguments) and the preflight step (sandbox runScript check) that precedes it, returning file:line citations. Scope: syntactic extraction from the requested range only, no semantic resolution of imported symbols. Limits: single file, single range, max 100 lines.","name":"extractExploreCallAfterPreflight","params":{"endLine":112,"file":"cli.ts","startLine":90},"question":"How does the CLI in cli.ts launch explore after the preflight step?","source":"({ file, startLine, endLine }: { file: string; startLine: number; endLine: number }) => {\n  const page = readLines(file, startLine, endLine);\n  const lines = page.lines;\n  const exploreCall = lines.filter(l => /\\bexplore\\s*\\(/.test(l.text));\n  const preflight = lines.filter(l => /runScript|preflight|Sandbox preflight/.test(l.text));\n  const awaitOrder = lines.filter(l => /await\\s+(explore|runScript|loadConfig)\\s*[\\({]/.test(l.text));\n  return {\n    file: page.file,\n    range: { start: page.start, end: page.start + lines.length - 1 },\n    exploreCall: exploreCall.map(l => ({ line: l.line, text: l.text })),\n    preflight: preflight.map(l => ({ line: l.line, text: l.text })),\n    awaitedSequence: awaitOrder.map(l => ({ line: l.line, text: l.text })),\n    truncatedLines: page.truncatedLines\n  };\n}"}}],"usage":{"inputTokens":4209,"outputTokens":471}},"model":{"model":"zai-glm-5-3-flash","temperature":0,"maxOutputTokens":16384}}
