d parameterize variations. When a stored procedure fails or is unusable for its declared subject, you may submit a corrected function_try under its existing id only if its purpose and contract remain unchanged; otherwise use a new name. Supply question as a stable canonical question independent of this Tour and a non-empty English description (ASCII only: no accented characters, even when the question is in French) stating what the procedure does, its scope, the shape of its result and its key limits. Every successfully executed function_try trial is automatically submitted to post-Tour selection — no remember flag is needed; the selection step considers actual contribution, correctness, documentation and duplication, and consolidation re-executes the exact code and params and re-checks every citation, so only deterministically validated selections persist. Do not wrap a primitive merely to remember it. Combine independent outputs in your Tour logic; never call one memorized procedure from another. Syntactic matches are candidates, not proven semantic relations; report missing evidence as uncertainty. If a stored function was selected for its declared subject but returned unusable output, call memory_unusable. The catalogue above is already complete: do not call memory_list to rediscover it. If no entry fits, build the missing procedure with function_try early instead of repeating searches."},{"role":"user","content":"Dans cli.ts, comment la CLI lance-t-elle explore après le préflight ? Examine uniquement les lignes 90 à 112, puis donne immédiatement une réponse JSON avec références et incertitudes."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-abd17ebc28e31b69","type":"function","function":{"name":"listFiles","arguments":"{}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-abd17ebc28e31b69","content":"{\"result\":[\".tours/.memory/b6f7ac2cdf7e9cfd6f12eaffefc3ebd7676d1e8405d5890db286e7a71df9299e.json\",\".tours/.memory/functions/findSymbolOccurrences.ts\